  "shortDescription": "Brand identity, packaging design, and website design",
  "aboutTech": "A diverse toolkit was essential for this multifaceted project. Illustrator handled the branding and vector graphics, while Dimension was used for 3D mockups. Photoshop took care of image editing, and After Effects was used for motion graphics. Figma was our go-to for web design prototyping, and Tilda finalized the web build. Each tool had its unique role, ensuring a polished and cohesive brand identity that aligned perfectly with the brand's mission.",
